Do not disable, hide or alter the branding link which is displayed on all the content generated by amCharts software unless you provide some other adequately prominent attribution to amCharts.
Provide the folloing text in the ReadMe_OSS " This software includes AmCharts, copyrighted by Antanas MErcelionis. For further details see https://github.com/amcharts/)

